      <div class="slide active" id="slide-1" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between; padding: 72px 96px;">
        
        <!-- Top Metadata Bar -->
        <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; width: 100%; border-bottom: 1.5px solid #000000; padding-bottom: 20px;">
          <span style="font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.4px;">넥스트 러너스  오즈 코딩스쿨  디자인 부트캠프 12기</span>
          <span style="font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.4px;">네이버페이 앱 UX/UI 개선 프로젝트</span>
