            <span style="font-size: 22px; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: -0.5px;">Period</span>
            <span style="font-size: 19px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: -0.3px;">2026.08.19 - 09.09 (3주 집중 프로젝트)</span>
